            <ArticleTitle>Environmental toxins; their impact on children's health.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>244-50</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Contamination of the environment by man-made and natural toxins has a direct impact on the health of children. This review considers how toxic contamination is identified and regulated, and highlights specific hazards.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
